--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -16,5 +16,11 @@ of its booking desk, written in TypeScript with no runtime dependency.
 Periods are UTC ISO-8601 strings at midnight; `end` is the start of the day after the last rental day, so
 `2026-07-01T00:00:00Z` to `2026-07-04T00:00:00Z` is three days. `quote` and `book` throw for an unknown
 item or a period that is not whole days; `book` also throws when the item is already booked for any part
-of the period. Cancellation (no refund under 24 hours before the start, full refund otherwise) is not
+of the period.
+
+`availability({ start, end, kind })` returns the ids, sorted, of the equipment that is free for the whole
+period; `kind` is optional and, when omitted, every kind is considered. It throws for a period that is not
+whole days or an unknown kind. An item booked for any part of the period is not listed.
+
+Cancellation (no refund under 24 hours before the start, full refund otherwise) is not
 implemented yet.
